{
  "rubric": "Each bar is a 0-100 index built from sourced 2025 figures, the same formula at every venue. Engine Power: 65% share of the fastest 2025 qualifying lap at full throttle by time (Formula Dream, FastF1 telemetry) + 35% top speed. Aero Efficiency: Pirelli downforce rating; low-downforce tracks score on drag efficiency instead (full-throttle share and top speed) when that is higher. Mechanical Grip: Pirelli traction rating, raised when Pirelli rates asphalt grip low. Braking Stability: Brembo 2025 difficulty index, adjusted by Pirelli's braking rating. Tyre Degradation: Pirelli tyre-stress rating, adjusted by asphalt abrasion and the hardest compound nominated. High-speed commitment: Pirelli lateral-load rating (fast corners), adjusted by full-throttle share; walls and runoff are not scored. Bands: LOW 0-39, MODERATE 40-64, HIGH 65-84, CRITICAL 85-94, EXTREME 95-100.",
  "dataThrough": "2025 season (Pirelli, Brembo, FastF1 qualifying telemetry)",
